ika field-type-image field-label-hidden\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field-items\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field-item even\u0022\u003E\u003Cimg typeof=\u0022foaf:Image\u0022 class=\u0022img-responsive\u0022 src=\u0022https:\/\/oldsite.finki.ukim.mk\/sites\/default\/files\/styles\/medium\/public\/full-rounded.png?itok=jGk-3G5F\u0022 width=\u0022220\u0022 height=\u0022220\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 \/\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field-items\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field-item even\u0022 property=\u0022content:encoded\u0022\u003E\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; font-size: medium;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPRIME Alert\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n05.03.2026 - 05.03.2029\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; font-size: medium;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ENATO Science for Peace and Security Program, SPS G8765\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https:\/\/prime-alert.finki.net.mk\u0022\u003Ehttps:\/\/prime-alert.finki.net.mk\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; font-size: medium;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EPRIME Alert\u003C\/strong\u003E (Personalised Micro Environmental Change Alert) is an innovative Artificial intelligence approach to improving safety, effectiveness and awareness of first responders\/soldiers in high-risk environments such as natural disasters (hurricanes, floods, fires) and combat scenarios (nerve gas, toxins in caves\/tunnels). Unlike other existing systems, this project is a comprehensive solution for real-time estimation of danger in the hazardous environments.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; font-size: medium;\u0022\u003EThe expected outcomes are affiliated to the AI enhanced on-site decisions, based on three sources: vital parameters sensors (SpO2, HR, RR), micro-environmental sensors (air quality, toxins, temperature), global environmental data (obtained from radars, weather stations). This system provides real-time health monitoring, stress-level assessment, and alerting utilizing automated speech. Responders\/soldiers communicate with the Command Unit, the multi-user continuous monitoring part, represented by a software platform that facilitates commands to the responders\/soldiers (regrouping, extraction). The Key objectives of the proposed solution are: integration of sensors, data collection, transformation, using artificial intelligence for Alerts generation and prediction of responders stress level, AI powered Speech recognition and automated health advice to the responders\/soldiers, as well as centralized connectivity with the Command Unit.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; font-size: medium;\u0022\u003EParticipating partners:\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Times New Roman\u0026quot;; font-size: medium;\u0022\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFCSE - N. Macedonia (Coordinator)\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- NPD: prof. Ana Madevska Bogdanova\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EMEI - Serbia\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- PPD: prof. Tatjana Loncar - Turukalo\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EFIIT \u2013 Slovakia\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- Co-Director: prof. Fedor Lehocki\u003Cbr \/\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EULB \u2013 Belgium\u003C\/strong\u003E\u003Cbr \/\u003E\n- Co-Director: Valerie Tommen\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field field-name-field-main-picture-to-show-in-ma field-type-list-boolean field-label-hidden\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field-items\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022field-item even\u0022\u003E1\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022easy_social_box clearfix horizontal easy_social_lang_mk\u0022\u003E\n            \u003Cdiv class=\u0022easy_social-widget easy_social-widget-twitter first\u0022\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022http:\/\/twitter.com\/share\u0022 class=\u0022twitter-share-button\u0022\ndata-url=\u0022https:\/\/oldsite.finki.ukim.mk\/mk\/content\/prime-alert\u0022\ndata-count=\u0022horizontal\u0022\ndata-lang = \u0022en\u0022\ndata-via=\u0022\u0022\ndata-related=\u0022:Check it out!\u0022\ndata-text=\u0022PRIME Alert \u0022\u003ETweet\u003C\/a\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n          \u003Cdiv class=\u0022easy_social-widget easy_social-widget-facebook\u0022\u003E\u003Cfb:like href=\u0022https:\/\/oldsite.finki.ukim.mk\/mk\/content\/prime-alert\u0022 send=\u0022true\u0022 layout=\u0022button_count\u0022 width=\u0022140\u0022 show_faces=\u0022true\u0022 action=\u0022like\u0022 colorscheme=\u0022light\u0022 font=\u0022\u0022\u003E\u003C\/fb:like\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n          \u003Cdiv class=\u0022easy_social-widget easy_social-widget-linkedin\u0022\u003E\u003Cscript type=\u0022in\/share\u0022 data-url=\u0022https:\/\/oldsite.finki.ukim.mk\/mk\/content\/prime-alert\u0022 data-counter=\u0022right\u0022\u003E\u003C\/script\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n          \u003Cdiv class=\u0022easy_social-widget easy_social-widget-googleplus last\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022g-plusone\u0022 data-size=\u0022medium\u0022 data-annotation=\u0022bubble\u0022 data-href=\u0022https:\/\/oldsite.finki.ukim.mk\/mk\/content\/prime-alert\u0022\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\u003C\/div\u003E\n  \u003C\/div\u003E \u003C!-- \/.easy_social_box --\u003E\u003C\/span\u003E\n\n\u003C\/div\u003E","latitude":"42.00410","longitude":"21.40958","title":"","markername":"","offset":"","":"","opts":{"title":""}},{"text":"\u003Cdiv class=\u0022gmap-popup\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv  about=