ojects and working with modern technologies in a professional and supportive environment.\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022x_MsoNormal\u0022 style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); margin: 0cm; font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan data-ogsc=\u0022black\u0022 style=\u0022border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Arial, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\u0022\u003E\u00a0As an intern, you will:\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003Cul style=\u0022color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: \u0026quot;Segoe UI\u0026quot;, \u0026quot;Segoe UI Web (West European)\u0026quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, \u0026quot;Helvetica Neue\u0026quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 0cm; margin-bottom: 0cm;\u0022\u003E\u003Cli data-ogsc=\u0022black\u0022 style=\u0022font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0cm;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan data-ogsc=\u0022\u0022 role=\u0022presentation\u0022 style=\u0022border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Arial, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\u0022\u003EContribute to ongoing, real-world projects\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-ogsc=\u0022black\u0022 style=\u0022font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0cm;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan data-ogsc=\u0022\u0022 role=\u0022presentation\u0022 style=\u0022border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Arial, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\u0022\u003EWork with modern technologies and tools\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-ogsc=\u0022black\u0022 style=\u0022font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0cm;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan data-ogsc=\u0022\u0022 role=\u0022presentation\u0022 style=\u0022border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Arial, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\u0022\u003EReceive guidance and continuous support from a dedicated mentor\u003C\/span\u003E\u003C\/li\u003E\n\u003Cli data-ogsc=\u0022black\u0022 style=\u0022font-family: Aptos, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; margin: 0cm;\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan data-ogsc=\u0022\u0022 role=\u0022presentation\u0022 style=\u0022border: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 10pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Arial, sans-serif, serif, EmojiFont; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; color: inherit;\u0022\u003ECollaborate with experienced professionals